Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:51.47,1:06:52.77,69b6bc9289beb44eddf0ab19,Umputun,0,0,0,,Скажу, что я ученик.
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:55.56,1:06:58.46,69b6bc9289beb44eddf0ab1a,Gray,0,0,0,,Да, 5249, точно.
